m/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_27292244040449194_3509206164409486334_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w9uiOgIQr8UQ7kNvwFB5PLZ&_nc_oc=AdokgDT4JDijUzcxFxoxWaivVeSPfw9ybm73BUCqxs8FJHpNdpIjIVT9rJwH6SkMIns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSFAvaAJGsR4na2rgyMmvT0PLiyP6bqYEDBvi5kkWNyJQ&oe=6B0C75F3"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots01.png", "id": "1109337971748811", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1109337975082144_2868233776751948265_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JUAeGZnBZLgQ7kNvwFwkmvS&_nc_oc=AdqgB0Cch0m0UlB188EMc2tDbZLf4Q2ZN38hf16L_LO-9xHgKfS6c_AS8cNyVmbGe8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTZ--lPYU2OB73yw2BCt0GliE6r6Yi36coTHNUBa7ZhNA&oe=6B0C6C8B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots07.png", "id": "1384542647199119", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1384542650532452_1440589814285122188_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DFjk6XlJ2nwQ7kNvwEQMSxY&_nc_oc=AdpzCAovBx8cAM94HhsACizIjWRUUK8f5oJB9GK5UT-uCVuXWzUMWD_-ZbDBfmMKhSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT2-k7Pn9Md2yfCH9sfMxZbw_w3mEcFVe4iDRc-pat_YQ&oe=6B0C7F44"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots02.png", "id": "1400532592047808", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_1400532595381141_3399314511837708075_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OD7j8xccA1YQ7kNvwHEz5OX&_nc_oc=AdpEXOtuRUPwwE2yyqDVVx7664oZ6r59vhZ_rl_LLzl3FmadTSYyjIDWP1FnOZ8HKOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSGH2ZpvMEJCKzcCxrEcQSa_Av4ASqs-eu94IQDdIwz6g&oe=6B0C8396"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_s logom.png", "id": "985519041223669", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_985519044557002_3272235211507795905_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iFiLwLx06r0Q7kNvwHLpMhF&_nc_oc=AdoLDoUzke3gkE8kR1h-6so2QT6SfhUy-iwJF0-ykju5gyXULl2NcFRNVFt8Lj8lyVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRVUv5js9fHxsf10h0DIBElu-5IrTk1i32nMmnbTItj8A&oe=6B0C52D0"}, "display_name": "Control Freek", "keywords": ["Reflex", "Speed", "Buttons", "Challenge", "Time"], "long_description": "# OPERATORS WANTED!\n\nWe are looking for new hands to join the assembling team of the HAPPY ITEMS CORPORATION (HI-CORP\u00ae) and race for maximum effectivity!\n\nYour task will be to control the HI-Console\u00ae and keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running. In other words: Press. Flick. Push. Pull. Levers. Cranks. Buttons. Switches.\n\nExecute each sequence in the correct and timely order to manufacture a certified HAPPY ITEM\u00ae. Successful completion resets the line: an infinite loop of productivity, purpose, and joy!\n\nYour duties:\n- Master increasingly complex variations of the HI-Console\u00ae controls\n- Outperform your Co-Operators on the global leaderboards and become Operator of the Month\n- Share one headset in Party Mode: colleagues, relatives and houseguests take turns at the HI-Console\u00ae, and every level keeps a local leaderboard so they can be ranked, compared, judged and thus motivated to improve\n- Operate to the sound of our tailor-composed HI-CORP\u00ae soundtrack, engineered for maximum joy\n- Most importantly: always have fun!\n\nAre you ready to push some levers and limits?\n\nHI-CORP\u00ae\nHuman Resource & Joy Management\n", "short_description": "Junior Operators wanted! Master the HI-Console\u00ae!\n\nA VR arcade game of pulling, flicking, and pressing analogue controls\nin fast, precise sequences to keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running.\n\nSpeed up, skill up and become Operator of the Month!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fono-labs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/contro